# Per-figure inputs. Small reference files are tracked; the large ones are
# symlinks to their canonical location elsewhere on the instance and stay ignored.
#   Figure_6/inputs/fimo/merged_fimo_output_clusters.tsv        -> Figures_SK/effect_size_final/...  (316M)
#   Figure_6/inputs/supertable/final_super_table_04_21_2025...  -> Figures_SK/General_preprocessing/ (126M)
#   Figure_1/inputs/clinvar_20240902.vcf                        -> Data/Sequences/GRCh38_hg38/       (1.2G)
#   SI_figures/SpliceAI_NSSM/inputs/spliceai_psi_logit.tsv      -> Figures_SK/Spliceai/all/          (23M)
